{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "unilms-student-app-api-v1",
    "name": "UniLMS - Student App & Portal APIs (All-In-One Single File)",
    "description": "### UniLMS Standalone All-In-One Student API Collection\n\n**Zero-Configuration Setup:** This collection is completely self-contained with built-in collection variables. You do NOT need any separate environment file!\n\n1. Import this single file into Postman.\n2. Open **01. Authentication & Session** -> Send **01. Student Multi-Tenant Login**.\n3. The access token and student ID are automatically saved directly into the collection.\n4. All 35+ APIs in all other folders work instantly!",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01. Authentication & Session",
      "description": "Student identity authentication, credentials verification, and JWT session token refresh.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "01. Student Multi-Tenant Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (data.accessToken) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('token', data.accessToken);",
                  "        console.log(\"Token stored in collection variables!\");",
                  "    }",
                  "    if (data.refreshToken) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', data.refreshToken);",
                  "    }",
                  "    if (data.user) {",
                  "        if (data.user.studentId) {",
                  "            pm.collectionVariables.set('studentId', data.user.studentId);",
                  "            console.log(\"Student ID stored:\", data.user.studentId);",
                  "        }",
                  "        if (data.user.tenant && data.user.tenant.code) {",
                  "            pm.collectionVariables.set('tenantCode', data.user.tenant.code);",
                  "        }",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"orgCode\": \"{{tenantCode}}\",\n  \"identifier\": \"{{identifier}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Authenticates student using their institution's unique Campus Code (orgCode), Roll Number / Email (identifier), and Password.\\n\\n**Required before sending:**\\n- Enter your institution's Campus Code in {{tenantCode}}\\n- Enter your student Roll Number in {{identifier}}\\n- Enter your student Password in {{password}}\\n\\nOn 200 OK, the test script automatically captures and saves {{token}}, {{refreshToken}}, and {{studentId}} into the collection variables."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "02. Refresh Session Access Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (data.accessToken) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('token', data.accessToken);",
                  "        console.log(\"Refreshed token stored!\");",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "refresh"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Refreshes expired short-lived JWT accessToken using long-lived refreshToken."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
